{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The last independent civilization has poured all its resources into creating a technological marvel\u2014a final stand against the Empire. You are the sole pilot on a hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time is of the essence. Your mission: swiftly gather resources to enhance your ship, eliminate key personnel within the Empire's ranks, and, if fortune favors you, take down the Emperor himself.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather valuable intel on alien technology to strengthen your cause.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete bounties on the Empire\u2019s generals to disrupt enemy operations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search for natural resources in space and on uncharted planets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But don\u2019t get ahead of yourself. The longer you remain in enemy territory, the greater the resistance you\u2019ll face. Your home planet remains a safe haven\u2014for now. Venture too far, and the danger will only escalate.<br><br><strong>Renegade Rush</strong> features a variety of upgrade systems, multiple currencies, and plenty of ways to earn them. The challenge gradually increases as you travel farther from your home planet and time progresses. Along the way, you\u2019ll encounter mini-bosses known as <i>Bounties</i>\u2014and maybe even discover a few surprises of your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563450/extras/zones.png?t=1744276931\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3563450?t=1744276931","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563450/1bef0029b9e27fc7007e192336e4a19924e867ee/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744276931","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563450/9238f302041f86cdab20faa5dc4b13c346a74461/capsule_231x87.jp